  "latestTerminalSummary": "Implemented and sealed in [t088p133-formal-v1](/home/mj-kang/Documents/Dev/math/openai-proof-research/frontier/campaigns/2026-10-14/t088p133-formal-v1/packet/public/README.md). **Pending independent review; no gate or count assigned.**\n\nFor all real α,β>0, α+β=2, 0<p<1, q=1−p, d≥0, P,N>0, with 2dp²<P and 2dq²≤N, Lean proves\n\\[\n(1+d)\\left(\\frac{p\\alpha}{\\alpha+P/p}+\\frac{q\\beta}{\\beta+N/q}\\right)<1.\n\\]\nAlso proved: the non-strict version, both bracket decompositions/signs, explicit moment conversions and positivity, and both one-sided deterministic bounds.\n\n- **Compilation:** 21 support declarations and 20 control theorems compile without warnings, including a fresh extracted-package rebuild.\n- **Axiom audit:** all 41 elaborated types checked; only `propext`, `Classical.choice`, `Quot.sound`. No prohibited proof shortcuts.\n- **Controls:** exact values 12/13, d=0 value 1/3, non-strict equality, and reason-checked countermodels for removed moment/positivity/normalization assumptions. All 11 copied artifact controls behaved as expected.\n- **Preservation:** supplied anchors authenticated; all 940 recorded original entries remain unchanged.\n- **Reproduction:** Python 3, Lean 4.34.1 and the pinned trusted mathlib/dependency cache. No clean-source mathlib rebuild claimed.\n\n[Coverage](/home/mj-kang/Documents/Dev/math/openai-proof-research/frontier/campaigns/2026-10-14/t088p133-formal-v1/packet/public/COVERAGE.md) explicitly excludes geometry, mixed volumes/attainment/coarea/Gamma, distributions/log-concavity/HNBUE, the ten-pattern certificate and its probabilistic interpretation, continuity/zero/repeated-knot assembly, simplex equality, and the final geometric theorem. No known implementation issue remains.\n\n[Portable source package](/home/mj-kang/Documents/Dev/math/openai-proof-research/frontier/campaigns/2026-10-14/t088p133-formal-v1/work/t088p133-formal-v1-source.tar.gz) excludes build caches and private bodies. [Final replay receipt](/home/mj-kang/Documents/Dev/math/openai-proof-research/frontier/campaigns/2026-10-14/t088p133-formal-v1/work/final-validation.json) records compilation, controls and preservation.\n\nDetached SHA256 handoff anchors:\n\n```text\nFINAL.json\n4fa662b09a569b1120f1fe524e6f7b8d81db0cdd6b021eef8027b1622ab15964\n\npacket/MANIFEST.json\n042edffc552a51b2c5a96cfdfca660de9ced1d2295106765f292dc546dd8210a\n\nOutside REPORT.md\n7c169c608cce6f452cf95ddee16ea1cc37fab8633d474d67d63e82245cdf1476\n\nT088P133.lean\n774a43c57993ff182189d28b370b9bb8f46d6342d764d45aa886500827d44de2\n\nControls.lean\nbceefda9b93f7ade2919cc83cfdef4a21670e23c7c8de7810873416f2ad5af9f\n\nPortable archive\n555e29786e1cf9a665036d639c3c28756a688e167f378d8bc68cbe29fe0bcc5f\n```",
